OL,3,GNEWSAPilot injured at airshow is out of
OL,4,Aintensive care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot who was left with life-changing
OL,7,Finjuries after an incident at an
OL,8,Fairshow has been released from
OL,9,Fintensive care.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at Stow Maries
OL,12,FGreat War Aerodrome in Purleigh, near
OL,13,FMaldon, at about 14:30 BST on 16
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FDuring a low-level display, one of The
OL,17,FTurbulent Team's light aircraft was
OL,18,Fdamaged and the pilot was injured, and
OL,19,Fthe show was stopped.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
