OL,3,GNEWSAPilot injured at airshow is out of
OL,4,Aintensive care
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Flint, chief executive officer,
OL,7,Fsaid: "This was a distressing incident,
OL,8,Fand we are all relieved to hear that
OL,9,Fthe pilot is continuing to recover."
